    "body": "This PR is a change to the CookieStore API spec to support partitioned cookies.\r\n\r\nThese changes could be used to support the [Partitioned attribute, a.k.a. CHIPS](https://github.com/WICG/CHIPS).\r\n\r\nThere is an [open PR](https://github.com/WICG/CHIPS/pull/24) in the CHIPS repository adding a note about these changes to the explainer.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
