    "created_at": "2023-08-15T19:54:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-15T19:54:09Z",
    "body": "> Thanks for clarifying! [source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:net/cookies/canonical_cookie_unittest.cc;l=731](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:net/cookies/canonical_cookie_unittest.cc;l=731) mislead me a bit I guess.\r\n\r\nAh, this is because Path=/ is required for the __Host- prefix, which that cookie also uses. I can see why that is initially confusing, especially considering Partitioned was originally designed to require __Host- but we loosened it to only require Secure 😄 ",
